  saldos antes: GS-EU-00000001=8771.21 EUR (pg-europa)   GS-AM-00000001=10511.54 USD (pg-america)

▶ 1. Ana (EU) transfere 100.00 EUR para o David (AM)
  POST /auth/login -> HTTP 200
  POST /transfers -> HTTP 201 (X-Served-By: api-1)
  ✔ transferência confirmada (HTTP 201)
    {
      "tx_id": "06aaf554-52b6-510d-823e-37afd1937eb3",
      "kind": "DISTRIBUIDA",
      "state": "CONFIRMADA",
      "amount": "100.00",
      "from_currency": "EUR",
